    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate released $33.1 million in prior year reserves in 2021. This favorable development was primarily driven by a consistent reserving philosophy, effective cycle management, and strategic actions such as a Loss Portfolio Transfer in the Property division. While the 2019 year of account was impacted by COVID-19 and natural catastrophes (Laura, Sally, Delta, Zeta, Dorian, Faxai, Hagibis), strong portfolio diversification and risk selection led to sizeable claims releases for that year. The Cyber & Executive Risk division also saw a net release despite increased ransomware claims activity in the 2020 underwriting year.",
